 "text": "You remember the exact moment you decided, where you were, what it felt like, you were so sure. Then life did what life does, work, money, tiredness you cannot explain. And the thing you were certain about became a thing you used to talk about. Nobody forgets their dreams, they just lose track of them. So picture yourself 10 years from now, looking back at today. Is that person hoping you let it go? Not a chance, they are willing you on. So write it down for them. One line, with today's date on it, that is what Demiore is. Phase one is live. You post what you are going to do, and it stays there, dated in public. It will not do it for you. It just makes sure you never lose the receipt. One day that archive is going to be full of people who kept their word, put yours in it, today.",
