 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.54,
   "text": "You remember the exact moment you decided,"
  },
  {
   "s": 3.0,
   "e": 6.62,
   "text": "where you were, what it felt like, you were so sure."
  },
  {
   "s": 7.3,
   "e": 11.4,
   "text": "Then life did what life does, work, money,"
  },
  {
   "s": 11.94,
   "e": 13.5,
   "text": "tiredness you cannot explain."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.16,
   "e": 15.72,
   "text": "And the thing you were certain about"
  },
  {
   "s": 15.72,
   "e": 17.84,
   "text": "became a thing you used to talk about."
  },
  {
   "s": 18.4,
   "e": 21.94,
   "text": "Nobody forgets their dreams, they just lose track of them."
  },
  {
   "s": 22.54,
   "e": 25.58,
   "text": "So picture yourself 10 years from now,"
  },
  {
   "s": 25.84,
   "e": 27.84,
   "text": "looking back at today."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.48,
   "e": 30.3,
   "text": "Is that person hoping you let it go?"
  },
  {
   "s": 30.8,
   "e": 33.48,
   "text": "Not a chance, they are willing you on."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.92,
   "e": 35.78,
   "text": "So write it down for them."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.18,
   "e": 39.26,
   "text": "One line, with today's date on it,"
  },
  {
   "s": 39.54,
   "e": 41.3,
   "text": "that is what Demiore is."
  },
  {
   "s": 41.76,
   "e": 43.06,
   "text": "Phase one is live."
  },
  {
   "s": 43.7,
   "e": 45.92,
   "text": "You post what you are going to do,"
  },
  {
   "s": 46.14,
   "e": 48.8,
   "text": "and it stays there, dated in public."
  },
  {
   "s": 49.38,
   "e": 51.3,
   "text": "It will not do it for you."
  },
  {
   "s": 51.66,
   "e": 54.46,
   "text": "It just makes sure you never lose the receipt."
  },
  {
   "s": 55.02,
   "e": 58.04,
   "text": "One day that archive is going to be full of people"
  },
  {
   "s": 58.04,
